  "scope": "Stream the sorted and deduplicated v2 flag coordinate pairs through a 32-byte row buffer into the temporary file. Preserve signature escaping, canonical bytes, the atomic replacement and exact revision and credit. The writer preserves the old commit on controlled temporary path refusal or invalid UTF-8 and successfully retries. The physical producer defers and replays its revision while the existing flag credit is occupied.",
